<title>CHINA: China coal mine explosion kills 91.</title>
<headline>China coal mine explosion kills 91.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A gas explosion at a coal mine in northern China has killed 91 people, an official said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The cause of the November 27 explosion at a small coal mine near Datong in Shanxi province was under investigation, an official of the rescue centre said by telephone.</p>
<p>Rescue workers were still searching for the missing but said there was no hope of finding survivors, he said.</p>
<p>Coal mine accidents kill about 10,000 people in China each year.</p>
</text>
